      "widgets_values": [
        "Summary: Use <Picture 1> as the identity, hairstyle, jewelry, and costume reference for one young East Asian woman in a misty ancient garden. Ignore the gray studio background and the multi-panel contact-sheet layout; create one single cinematic scene with one woman only.\n\nNarration: Cinematic 16:9 composition, one continuous shot, no cuts, no split screen, no duplicated panels. Start with a full-body shot of the woman from <Picture 1> standing on a wet stone path in a misty jade garden at blue hour. She wears the same pale blue and white layered hanfu dress, long flowing sleeves, silver-white feather-and-flower headpiece with a green gemstone, long straight black hair, pearl earrings, and the green pendant necklace shown in the reference. White petals drift through the air and thin mist moves near the ground.\n\nShe walks slowly toward the camera, turns 180 degrees to show the back of the dress and the long hair, then turns back to face the camera. The camera tracks smoothly from a full-body view to a side profile, then arcs around her and settles into a medium close-up. Her sleeves and hair react naturally to the wind. The costume construction, embroidery, jewelry, and face stay consistent with <Picture 1>. No text, no logos, no subtitles, no overlays, no extra people, no contact-sheet borders.\n\nSpeaker_1's Appearance: The same young East Asian woman from <Picture 1>: fair skin, delicate features, dark eyes, long straight black hair, pale blue and white layered hanfu, silver-white feather-and-flower crown with a green center stone, pearl earrings, and a green gemstone pendant.\n\nSpeaker_1's Actions: She walks forward, turns to show the back of the costume, turns back, lifts one wide sleeve slightly, and looks directly into the camera. Her hands and fingers remain anatomically natural. The dress, hair, jewelry, and headpiece do not change shape or color.\n\nSpeaker_1's Facial Expression: Calm and ethereal at first, then warm and direct in the final close-up.\n\nSpeaker 1 (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 这是参考图一致性测试。请保持人物脸、发饰、服装和首饰一致，并检查转身时背面和正面是否连续。</d>\n\nSpeaker_1's Voice Description: Young adult female, soft, clear Mandarin, gentle and slightly ethereal.\n\nSound-Visual Alignment: Soft footsteps on wet stone, light fabric rustle, wind through leaves, and a faint wind-chime shimmer. Clear dry voice with no music. Natural lip sync, no overlapping speech.",
        1344,
        768,
        124,
        "max"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
